OL,3,GNEWSAFire operation ends in New Forest
OL,4,Aafter two weeks
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirefighters are due to leave the New
OL,7,FForest later, two weeks after the
OL,8,Foutbreak of a devastating wildfire.
OL,10,FMore than 1 sq km (247 acres) of the
OL,11,Fnational park has been destroyed since
OL,12,Fthe fire spread from a blazing van on 9
OL,13,FAugust.
OL,15,FOn Saturday, the A31 dual carriageway
OL,16,Fbetween Southampton and Bournemouth was
OL,17,Freopened, with a lane closure and speed
OL,18,Flimits in force.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
