OL,3,GNEWSAFire operation ends in New Forest
OL,4,Aafter two weeks
OL,5,
OL,6,FRecent reports of smoke in the area are
OL,7,Fthought to be no more than dust and
OL,8,Fdebris carried by the wind, Hampshire
OL,9,Fand Isle of Wight Fire and Rescue
OL,10,FService (HIWFRS) said.
